  "summary": "Zero-Shot Video Restoration and Enhancement with Assistance of Video Diffusion Models and Selective Generative Video Deraining (SGVD) both address challenges in video restoration and enhancement using diffusion models, with SGVD offering improved temporal consistency and adaptive restoration.",
